From e48aa88729b395a431dcb6c8313e0554a1619c61 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:14:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/28] test-posix: Check equal descriptors, FD_CLOEXEC and
 errors in dup, dup2 and dup3

---
 test/test-posix/test-unistd/CMakeLists.txt |   1 +
 test/test-posix/test-unistd/meson.build    |   1 +
 test/test-posix/test-unistd/test-dup2.c    | 210 +++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 212 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 test/test-posix/test-unistd/test-dup2.c

